GENERAL COMMENTS:                                                  725 1451
   The ENDF/B-VI data file for N14 is an essentially complete new  725 1451
evaluation. Below 2.5 MeV, it consists of an R-matrix analysis of  725 1451
the available experimental total, elastic, (n,p0), and (n,alpha0)  725 1451
cross sections and angular distributions using the EDA coupled-    725 1451
channel r-matrix code. At higher energies, the evaluation          725 1451
is an update of the 1972 evaluation of Young and Foster [Yo72]     725 1451
to include new experimental data since that time. More details     725 1451
of the evaluation are included below.                              725 1451
                                                                   725 1451
